   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "General pattern of endings",
     "texto": [
      "The thematic vowel of each conjugation is kept: **-are** gives **-avo, -avi, -ava, -avamo, -avate, -avano** (*giocare → giocavo*); **-ere** gives **-evo, -evi, -eva, -evamo, -evate, -evano** (*scrivere → scrivevo*); **-ire** gives **-ivo, -ivi, -iva, -ivamo, -ivate, -ivano** (*partire → partivo*)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs in continuous use",
     "texto": [
      "Knowing these endings lets you describe any past routine: *Da piccoli giocavamo spesso insieme* (as children we often played together); *Mentre studiavamo, pioveva* (while we were studying, it was raining)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
